@baseUrl = http://localhost:5146

### Create a ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "ATM out of service",
  "assetCode": "atm-0451",
  "description": "The screen does not respond.",
  "reportedBy": "Carlos Ruiz"
}

### Get all tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets

### Get pending tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets?status=Pending

### Get a ticket by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/1

### Move ticket 1 to InProgress (valid)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetStatus": "InProgress",
  "changedBy": "Lucia Mendez"
}

### Resolve without diagnosis (400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetStatus": "Resolved",
  "changedBy": "Lucia Mendez"
}

### Resolve with diagnosis (200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetStatus": "Resolved",
  "comment": "Screen cable replaced.",
  "changedBy": "Lucia Mendez"
}

### Invalid transition: Pending -> Resolved (409)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetStatus": "Resolved",
  "comment": "Fixed",
  "changedBy": "Lucia Mendez"
}

### Ticket history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/1/history